 ('elements','.tsru-remove-element','Remove Element','Remove this reusable Element definition from the editor. Check existing Actor/weakness references to its ID before saving.'),
 ('elements','.tsru-add-element','Add Element','Add a reusable Element entry with a stable ID, display name, icon and charge/ready colors.'),
 ('paths','.tsru-remove-path','Remove Path','Remove this Path definition from the editor; check existing Actor and equipment references before saving.'),
 ('paths','.tsru-add-path','Add Path','Add a reusable Path with stable identifier, name, icon and presentation color.'),
